    "text": "By Staff Report ,\n7 hours ago A woman who came home drunk was arrested after an altercation in The Villages. Sumter County sheriff’s deputies were called shortly before 10 p.m. Monday to a home in the Village of Belvedere after an altercation between 40-year-old Jessica Anne Delima and a male occupant of the home, according to an arrest report. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 11",
